WEBVTT

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.770
A fierce Transformer Wars between the righteous Cybertron and the evil Decepticons...

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:54.360
...has brought a new stage to the Decepticons with the advent of the new destroyer, the Violent Jaeger and General Kyudai Ma.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.350
Holy, take care of the others!

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:33.590
Yes, sir!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.450
She

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:30.000
You are the great destroyer of the Decepticons.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.990
Lord Violent Zyger.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:39.170
Commander of the Autobots, Victory Saber has vanished into thin air.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:48.610
I will conquer this great universe and create the Decepticon Zone.

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:54.820
The super-energy needed for that, I will definitely collect it.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.000
New Commander, the Great Atlas has appeared.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.000
What do you think?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.210
It's the best way to live in space!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.000
Haha, that's right!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.160
Navigator!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:41.430
This Zone is the largest space defense system of the Cybatron using the Super Energy Energon-Z!

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:49.830
That's right. It's said that the Powered Master created the Zone, right?

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.180
Yes. They are pioneers of the universe.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:59.060
They support the evolution of life and civilization, and are the heroes of the Transformers who fight to build a peaceful paradise of dreams in the galaxy!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:22.260
I don't see a single flower.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:25.120
But this is a super-scientific planet.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.090
I wonder if Moon Radar is lonely.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.230
No, it's not like that.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:30.000
No, it's not like that.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:35.600
We're not animals! We're bloodthirsty humans!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.600
Hey, hey, we're also animals.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.510
We're super-robot lifeforms.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.450
Don't say that, Ms. M.

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:50.850
It's a Decepticon!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.250
Defcon 2, prepare for battle!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.200
What should we do?

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.210
The Powered Masters went looking for the Victory Saber,

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.610
but they haven't returned yet.

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.000
They've misplaced the power of the Zone Base.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.880
Defcon 1, begin battle!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:42.740
I'll kill you all!

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:50.480
Chip Attack!

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:51.990
Hehehehe...

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.540
I've found it!

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.570
The Energon Z is...

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:17.910
Get up!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:26.440
Battle Team and Super Car Team, come with us!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.670
Rescue Team, repair!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.000
Jet Team, check every base!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.410
Follow me!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.120
It's Black Zarok!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.680
The rocket will slowly collapse!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:30.000
Please cut off the power gate!

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.120
Roger that!

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:35.010
Thank you!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.030
Where did the Destron go?

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:36.880
Leave it to me.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.020
Sunrunner!

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.880
Use your proud radar to find it!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:44.320
I've found it!

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:46.370
It's joining with another unit!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:51.230
It's moving in another direction!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.210
The direction is...

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.190
Earth!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.190
Well done, Sunrunner!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.170
As expected of Hawkeye!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.170
He's got the eye of a hawk!

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.000
What are they doing with the Energon Z?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.780
Hurry up and follow me!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.940
Anyway, we're going to follow them!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:10.390
What should we do? What should we do?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:14.060
Don't worry about it. Moon Raiders will be fine.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:18.180
At a time like this, if only the Commander-in-Chief and the Powered Master were here...

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:28.870
Gaiatlus!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.430
Sonic Bomber!

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.690
I'm sorry!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:45.470
Folia, hurry up and take care of the wound.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:51.310
The Decepticons' goal is to take Zodiac, the ancient object that sleeps on Earth.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:52.310
Zodiac?

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:56.410
A mysterious energy that has the power of space creation.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:11:00.000
If we become the energy of the Autobots, Energon Z,

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:04.230
It is said that super-energy is created by making stars.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.820
You don't need me! I'm going!

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:13.250
- The planet! - The planet!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.750
I'm the Cybertron's Micro Transformer.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.850
Cybertron...

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.960
Transform!

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:44.100
That was dangerous.

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:47.280
Don't worry. I'm Kain. Nice to meet you.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.740
I'm Akira.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.440
I'm Ms. M.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.120
We're from the Feminine Generation.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.150
Oh, really?

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:57.230
Earth is a beautiful planet.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.640
There are so many Ms. M's!

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.090
Moon Radar, another Decepticon has been spotted!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.000
Alright, everyone, get ready!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.110
We're going to fight the Decepticons with all our might!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.000
I'll protect you!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.810
BOOM!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.180
BOOM!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:21.420
BOOM!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:27.330
Here it comes!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.250
Here it comes!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:29.250
You!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.000
You!

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:33.030
I'm Sonic Bomber. Nice to meet you.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.930
Powered Master!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.850
Powered Master is here!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:37.960
Yay!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.040
Cool!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:43.150
We won't allow you Decepticons to step out of this world!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.150
What are you talking about?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.150
I'll kill you!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.150
I'm going to face Sonic Bomber!

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.980
Die!

00:14:53.220 --> 00:15:00.000
I'll crush your guns with my armor gear!

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:02.640
I'll kill you!

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:14.690
I'll kill you!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.430
You're not just an idiot, you're also a coward!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.370
I'll kill you!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:17.790
I'll kill you!

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:18.550
I'll kill you!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:24.270
Now, Demaster!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.600
Demaster!

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:29.470
I, Zodiac, will not let you escape!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.000
Zodiac!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.750
I'll leave the rest to you!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.970
I won't let you do that!

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:41.900
Zodiac Adson, back on!

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:46.320
Where did it go?

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:50.480
A space 15,000 meters from the ground.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.990
Is it an underground tunnel?

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:14.220
The energy wave is 1000 meters ahead.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:21.910
That's an incredible amount.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:28.160
Zodiac!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.920
I've found it!

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:49.450
Thank you for the food.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.790
Well done, King Poseidon.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.350
That's too bad, Diatlus.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.000
King Poseidon!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.550
-Go! -Understood!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:06.410
I'll make you pay for this!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:11.300
That's right. This is 15,000 meters underground.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:49.940
-Return to normal! -Return to normal!

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:54.310
-It's the Zodiac! -It's the Zodiac!

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:55.280
-It's the Zodiac! -I can't take it!

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:59.060
-I can't take it! -I can't take it!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:05.090
Take this! Energon Z!

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.310
X-Bomb!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.780
Run away!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:24.410
Alright!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.330
Ichikawa Chika!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:29.600
Your soul!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:34.160
Give us the power to create the universe!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.640
The brilliance of the zodiac!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:53.130
There it is!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:58.100
Impossible! The enemy's armor gear is...

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.520
I have a great skill.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.300
So!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.870
One point!

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:50.520
What's the truth?

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:56.900
This Zodiac is the power that created the Earth and the galaxy.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:59.860
So this is what your father said about the Zodiac.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:03.200
Wow, you really know about Zodiacs.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.180
My dad is an earth physicist.

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:06.840
Tch!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:11.520
I know more about the universe and Transformers than you do.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:15.010
But this earth is a really wonderful planet.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.730
Yeah. I want to know more about this planet.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:22.810
But instead, tell me more about the universe and Transformers!

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.450
Leave it to me if that's what you want.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:29.480
-What? -What? Is that okay?

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.250
You are very welcome.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.830
Please tell everyone in the Zone about the Earth.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:43.790
Let's bring a lot of souvenirs!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:22:00.000
On behalf of Cybatron, I am Howard Mason.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:07.590
I hereby appoint Master Diatolas as the new Commander-in-Chief!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:11.470
Diatolas, who has become the new Commander-in-Chief of the Cybertron...

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:16.680
...will defend the universe from the evil Decepticons in his heart...

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:21.000
...and build a beautiful, peaceful paradise in the galaxy with the help of his beloved friend.
